  "item_short_desc": "<p>Easily store small gear and tactical essentials with Rothco&rsquo;s MOLLE Roll-Up Utility Dump Pouch. Designed for rugged use, this versatile pouch features MOLLE straps for easy attachment to MOLLE vests, backpacks, and more. The pouch offers a secure cord lock drawstring closure and a hook &amp; loop flap closure to keep your items safe while you're out in the field.</p>",
